    <briefdescription>
<para>Length-prefixed <computeroutput><ref refid="classint" kindref="compound">int</ref></computeroutput> array, the integer counterpart of <computeroutput>M2_string</computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Same layout as <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_m2__string__struct" kindref="compound">M2_string_struct</ref></computeroutput> but with an <computeroutput><ref refid="classint" kindref="compound">int</ref></computeroutput> payload. <computeroutput><ref refid="m2-types_8h_a071c143092bff3ecfb25de7581dfba58_1a071c143092bff3ecfb25de7581dfba58" kindref="member">M2_arrayintOrNull</ref></computeroutput> is the nullable typedef used in interface signatures where the call may legitimately return nothing. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
